\fs24\lang8192\langfe8192\kerning2\loch\af31506\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\cgrid\langnp8192\langfenp8192 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 1.1 Introduction
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5531619\charrsid5531619 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Lung cancer is responsible for one of the highest death rates across the globe because it often has advanced by diagnosis and the rapid nature at which it grows. Patients diagnosed with lung cancer using medical imaging technology (CT scan) and detected b
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 efore their illness has progressed show improved survival rates.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13451543\charrsid13451543 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
 Traditionally, human interpretation has been used by lung radiologists to detect lung nodules through the evaluation of CT scans; however, this method is slow, time-consuming, labor-intensive, and prone to error; furthermore, evaluation rates differ sign
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 ificantly by radiologist.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13451543 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970\charrsid2249970 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Due to advances in Artificial Intelligence / Deep Learning technology, automation to analyze medical images has significantly improved. Feature extraction from CT scan images is accomplished through Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs), which can now prov
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
ide very accurate classifications of lung nodule presence or absence. This would have a major impact on patient outcomes by allowing Radiologists to detect lung cancer earlier, reduce diagnostic errors, and improve workflow efficiencies.}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
CT image quality is often degraded/incomplete due to motion artifacts, low resolution, noise, and missing slices when viewed in real clinical environments. AI models that have been developed to classify CT images have primarily been trained on datasets th
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
at are clean and ideal, which limits the ability of these AI models to be applicable in real-life situations. The purpose of this project is to develop a robust deep-learning model for detecting lung cancer accurately within blurred, noisy, or incomplete 
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 CT\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506  images.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid16261533 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 1.2 Problem Description
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13451543 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13451543 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Previously conducted studies have demonstrated effective performance of AI algorithms in determining the presence of lung cancer using a pre-specified design for clean datasets. When using pre-specified designs to determine whether or not to use a CT imag
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
e with degraded or missing data, the performance of the same AI algorithms has been shown to follow a decrease in performance. Few AI systems currently have been implemented with a user-friendly interface for use by researchers and clinicians.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The purpose o\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 f this paper is to address:
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 1. Blurred and noisy CT images hinder the visibility of nodular (tumor) glial cells by reducing predictive accuracy of nodular detection.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 2. Missing data, missing slices, and class imbalance contribute to the creation of incomplete databases, thereby contributing to poor model training and generalization.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 3. The lack of a user-friendly interface for the testing of the AI model also limits its usefulness for research or demonstration purposes.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5451033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
This study presents a deep learning framework for handling degraded or incomplete CT image data, with an integrated Flask-based web application for the purpose of showcasing a research-oriented project for the detection of lung cancer.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 1.3 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Objective Research
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 The goals of this research project are to:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2249970 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 - }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid2249970 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Develop and validate an approach based on a convolutional neural network to identify lung cancer from computed tomography (CT) scans, even when they contain missing segments, noise, or some other defects.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid2249970 
\loch\af1\dbch\af31505\hich\f1 \u8239\'a0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970 
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 - Provide pre-processing and data augmentation procedures to enable researchers to develop more reliable models.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13451543 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 - }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid13451543\charrsid13451543 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Evaluate how well the predictive performance of lung cancer detection improves across different imaging scenarios (including clean images, images with a degree of poor quality, and images that are incomplete). }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid13451543 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13451543\charrsid13451543 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
To develop a prototype decision-support system (a web-based application based on Flask) which can be used for testing and demonstrating various capabilities.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13451543 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid13451543\charrsid13451543 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Establish and measure the robustness of decision-support systems with various model metrics (accuracy, precision/recall, F1 Score, etc.) as they relate to the real-world performance of clinical imaging.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid2249970 

\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5451033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 1.4 Project Scope
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 This project encompasses:
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Creation and training of a Convolution Neural Network (CNN) - ResNet-based model that assists with diagnosing lung cancer through CT imaging.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Dealing with real-world imaging issues like blurry images, noisy images and incomplete datasets.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 Creating a web application using Flask to be able to visualize the predictions made by this model interactively.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
This project will be developed solely for academic and research purposes and will not be used for professional diagnostic purposes or for any patient care. All datasets that are being used for this project are publicly available datasets, as well as simul
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 ated degradation of images.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5451033 
