This study is focused on answering the following research questions:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5531619 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5531619\charrsid5531619 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Can a deep learning model correctly identify lung cancer from either a very blurred CT (computed tomography) scan picture or from a CT dataset with excessive noise? Also, what impact does using data augmentation (techniques used to artificially increase t
\hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 he size of a dataset) with various other types of image processing have on performance of an existing model developed by using degraded datasets?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid5531619 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid10038949 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 When validation on an incomplete dataset the model continues to provide consistent and accurate prediction.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10038949 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid10038949 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Will a web application using Flask be able to show how the model can support decision making?
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 1.7 Methodology Overview
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 This study will use publicly available datasets of lung CT scans (ie. LIDC-IDRI), to perform the following:
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 a. Acquire CT image data, resize, normalize, and blur/add noise to the data to simulate real-world conditions.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 b. Resolve incomplete datasets using augmentation and balancing methods.
\par \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 c. Train a deep learning model (Convolutional Neural Network/ResNet/EfficientNet) using clean, degraded and incomplete datasets of images.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid10038949 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl278\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1208305 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid1208305 \hich\af31506\dbch\af31505\loch\f31506 
Create a web application (Flask) that allows users to upload CT images and view prediction results.
